 een from Barcelona\, ES.\nThe Moon is 2° up · daylight\, Sun +41°.\nTim
 es for the Moon's mean limb\, ±2 s.\nMap\, timings and the view at the Mo
 on's edge: https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?lat=41.3888&lon=2.159
 0
URL:https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?lat=41.3888&lon=2.1590
